0d068653-072a-4886-b401-1e968cb67c39	ai-1775392008462-nwoafj7	completed	[{"role":"assistant","content":"Hi, I'm Max — the van builder for Mobile Tyre Van City. I'm going to ask you a few quick questions and put together a full, priced van specification based on your answers — takes less than 5 minutes and you'll end up with a build you can review, tweak and request a quote from. Let's get started — are you just starting out in mobile tyres, expanding an existing fleet, or replacing one of your current vans?"},{"role":"user","content":"I have a garage and want to go mobile too"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Got it — starting mobile alongside your garage sounds like a solid move. How many tyre jobs are you aiming to do per day with the van?"},{"role":"user","content":"10-15 oper day"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Nice steady volume — that's right in the sweet spot for a growing operation. And what type of vehicles will you mainly be working on — cars and light vans, commercials like HGVs and LCVs, or a mix of both?"},{"role":"user","content":"generally cars"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Perfect — cars and light vans it is. Do you already have a van you want us to convert, or would you need us to supply one as part of the package?"},{"role":"user","content":"no I need a van"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Great — we have a really good selection in stock at the moment, Sprinters, Transits, Customs and Crafters. The team will go through the specific models and pricing with you on the call. For now, let's make sure the conversion is specced out perfectly. Do you think an MWB (Medium Wheelbase) van, which is great for tight spaces and residential streets, or an LWB (Long Wheelbase) van for maximum capacity, would suit you better?"},{"role":"user","content":"lwb plkease"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Good choice — LWB gives you maximum capacity, ideal for your workload. Now, do you prefer a standard tyre changer, or would you like a fully automatic one with assist arms? The fully auto version makes run-flats and low-profile tyres a lot easier to handle. A lot of our customers wish they'd gone fully auto from the start — but it's a bit more kit."},{"role":"user","content":"fully auto please"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Great choice — fully automatic with assist arms is perfect for handling run-flats and low-profile tyres, especially at your job volume. Based on your workload and starting out mobile, I'd recommend our Silver package. It includes a light pack, dash camera, reversing camera, and a vehicle tracker — it's our most popular setup for growing operations. Want to go with that, or would you like to see what's in the Gold tier too?"},{"role":"user","content":"yes please"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Excellent choice — the Silver package is a great fit for your setup. Let’s lock that in and keep going."},{"role":"user","content":"whats in the gold"},{"role":"assistant","content":"The Gold package is geared for high-volume operators. It comes with a light pack, Van Online CCTV/NVR System, Apple CarPlay, Accessories Pack 3, a vehicle tracker, and a vehicle immobiliser. It's ideal if you want maximum capability from day one. Would you like to upgrade to Gold, or stick with Silver?"},{"role":"user","content":"stick with silver"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Silver it is — great choice for your setup and workload. Before we lock this in — can I tell you about something most customers say is the best thing about their van once they're out on the road? It's our 48V lithium silent compressor system. Completely silent operation, zero fuel cost, and works with doors shut in winter — no fumes, no cold. Want to include this on your build?"},{"role":"user","content":"yes"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Brilliant — the 48V lithium silent compressor system is now part of your build. Let’s wrap this up and take a look at your full van spec."}]	{"ownVan":false,"vanSize":"LWB","serviceType":"car","isEuro6":true,"machineType":"fully-auto","packageId":"silver","kitId":"pack-4-euro6-t2000","upgradeIds":["light-pack","front-facing-dash-camera","standard-reversing-camera","accessories-pack-2","vehicle-tracker","air-reel-fini"],"financePlanId":null,"financePreference":null,"includes48v":true,"contactName":null,"contactPhone":null}	\N	\N	car	LWB	pack-4-euro6-t2000	\N	t	t	yes	[]	["air-reel-fini"]	t	f	2026-04-05 12:29:27.466728	2026-04-05 12:29:27.466	\N	\N	\N	\N	[]	\N
5f9cec40-a596-4c42-bc47-4ad0e6e5ea1e	ai-1777711984778-mre55tk	completed	[{"role":"assistant","content":"Hi Gaz — I'm Max, the van builder for Mobile Tyre Van City. I'm going to ask you a few quick questions and put together a full, priced conversion spec for you — takes about 5 minutes. So, are you just starting out in mobile tyres, expanding an existing fleet, or replacing one of your current vans?"},{"role":"user","content":"newe t it"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Got it, Gaz — you're starting fresh in mobile tyres. Exciting times! Roughly how many tyre jobs are you planning to do per day?"},{"role":"user","content":"10"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Solid starting point, Gaz. And what type of vehicles will you mainly be working on — cars and light vans, commercials like HGVs and LCVs, or a mix of both?"},{"role":"user","content":"bit of everything"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Got it, Gaz — a mix of everything. That sets you up for a hybrid spec. Do you already have a van you'd like us to convert, or do you need us to supply one as part of the package?"},{"role":"user","content":"I ned a van"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Great — we have a really good selection in stock at the moment — Sprinters, full-size Transits, and Crafters. The team will go through the specific models and pricing with you on the call. For now, let's make sure the conversion is specced out perfectly. Based on your workload, most customers at 10 jobs a day go for MWB (Medium Wheelbase) — it's great for tight spaces and residential streets. Does that sound right?"},{"role":"user","content":"probably a lwb"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Good call, Gaz — LWB gives you maximum capacity for a mix of vehicles. Now, do you want a standard tyre changer (semi-auto), or would you prefer a fully automatic one with assist arms? Fully auto makes run-flats and low-profile tyres easier to handle, and a lot of our customers wish they'd gone fully auto from the start — but it’s a bit more kit."},{"role":"user","content":"auto"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Fully auto it is, Gaz — solid choice for handling everything, especially run-flats and low-profiles. Based on that, I'll set you up with the full kit. Now, based on your 10 jobs a day and hybrid workload, I'd recommend our Silver package. Here's everything it includes:\\n\\n• Light Pack\\n• Front Facing Dash Camera\\n• Standard Reversing Camera Kit\\n• Accessories Pack 2\\n• Vehicle Tracker\\n\\nThis is our most popular choice for growing operations and gives you a professional setup without going full premium. Want to go with that, or curious what the Gold adds on top?"},{"role":"user","content":"that's fine"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Great choice, Gaz — the Silver package is perfect for your setup. Let’s lock that in. Before we finish, can I tell you about an optional upgrade most of our customers absolutely love? It’s a 48V lithium silent compressor system. It’s completely silent, runs off a battery with zero fuel cost, and lets you work with the doors shut in winter — no fumes, no cold. Worth adding, or shall we stick with the standard compressor?"},{"role":"user","content":"yes"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Perfect, Gaz — I’ll add the 48V system to your build. That’s a top-tier upgrade most customers rave about. Let’s wrap this up! How are you looking to fund this — buy outright, business lease, or spread the cost with finance?"},{"role":"user","content":"finance"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Got it, Gaz — we’ll look at finance options for you. I’ll get everything priced up and ready. One last thing — shall I have one of our team give you a ring to go over the numbers and get things moving? If so, you’re happy for us to use your number, 07525370107?"},{"role":"user","content":"yes"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Perfect, Gaz — I’ll make sure the team has your number alongside the build. Let me get your full spec up now."}]	{"ownVan":false,"vanSize":"LWB","serviceType":"hybrid","isEuro6":true,"machineType":"fully-auto","packageId":"silver","kitId":"pack-4-euro6-t2000","upgradeIds":["light-pack-upgraded","front-facing-dash-camera","standard-reversing-camera","accessories-pack-2","vehicle-tracker","air-reel-fini"],"financePlanId":null,"financePreference":"finance","includes48v":true,"contactName":"gaz","contactPhone":"07525370107"}	gaz	07525370107	hybrid	LWB	pack-4-euro6-t2000	finance	t	t	yes	[]	["air-reel-fini"]	t	f	2026-05-02 08:53:11.318177	2026-05-02 08:55:06.301	\N	1d895c79-f97c-484c-8feb-a9d0ab2856db	\N	\N	[]	\N
