 perfect for your job volume and working across all vehicle types. Now, do you want a standard tyre changer, or would you prefer a fully automatic one with assist arms? The fully auto version makes handling run-flats and low-profiles much easier, especially at higher volumes like yours."},{"role":"user","content":"fully auto"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Fully automatic with assist arms — excellent choice for a busy workload like yours. I'll set that up. Based on your setup so far, I'd recommend our Silver package. Here's everything it includes:\\n\\n• Light Pack\\n• Front Facing Dash Camera\\n• Standard Reversing Camera Kit\\n• Accessories Pack 2\\n• Vehicle tracker\\n\\nThis is our most popular package for operators at your volume — it’s a perfect balance of kit and cost. Want to go with this, or should we explore the Gold package for even more capability?"},{"role":"user","content":"that's great ill go for that"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Perfect — you’ve made a solid choice with the Silver package. Before we lock this in, can I tell you about something most of our customers say is the best thing about their van once they're out on the road?\\n\\nWe fit a 48V lithium silent compressor system using an ABAC professional compressor. It’s completely silent — no generator noise while you work. Runs off the lithium battery, not the engine, so zero fuel cost. You can work with doors shut in winter — no fumes, no cold. The ABAC compressor runs at 10 bar at 100% duty cycle, flat out all day. The power system — battery, inverter, and all electrical components — comes with a 5-year warranty. The compressor itself has a 12-month warranty with servicing only every 3,000 run hours. Want to include this on your build?"},{"role":"user","content":"yes"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Great choice — the 48V silent compressor system will be a game-changer for your setup. Let’s move on to the final details. How are you looking to fund this — buy outright, business lease, or spread the cost with finance?"},{"role":"user","content":"finance"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Got it — I'll note down finance as your preference. Great — I'll get that all priced up for you now. Do you want one of our team to give you a ring to go over the numbers and get things moving? If so, I'll use the number we already have: 0752537107."},{"role":"user","content":"yes"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Perfect — I’ll make sure the team has your number alongside the build. Let me get your full spec up now."}]	{"ownVan":false,"vanSize":"LWB","serviceType":"hybrid","isEuro6":true,"machineType":"fully-auto","packageId":"silver","kitId":"pack-4-euro6-t2000","upgradeIds":["light-pack-upgraded","front-facing-dash-camera","standard-reversing-camera","accessories-pack-2","vehicle-tracker","air-reel-fini"],"financePlanId":null,"financePreference":"finance","includes48v":true,"contactName":"gaz","contactPhone":"0752537107"}	gaz	0752537107	hybrid	LWB	pack-4-euro6-t2000	finance	t	t	yes	[]	["air-reel-fini"]	t	f	2026-05-02 09:07:25.17796	2026-05-02 09:09:50.514	\N	bb124227-5cef-4c6e-881d-e0c0f5e50bc7	\N	\N	[]	\N
64a9787c-fafc-4e4f-b901-bd101717e996	ai-1775387412695-5l8cwby	in_progress	[{"role":"assistant","content":"First up — are you just starting out in mobile tyres, expanding an existing fleet, or replacing one of your current vans?"},{"role":"user","content":"im new"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Good stuff — starting fresh means we can set you up with exactly what you need. Roughly how many tyre jobs are you looking to do per day?"},{"role":"user","content":"I chat I cant see what im typing"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Ah, no worries — just let me know roughly how many tyre jobs you're planning to do per day, and we'll keep things moving."},{"role":"user","content":"I dont know im new to this"},{"role":"assistant","content":"No problem at all — for most people starting out, aiming for under 10 jobs per day is a good place to begin. Do you already have a van you'd like us to convert, or do you need us to supply one as part of the package?"},{"role":"user","content":"I have a van"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Perfect — we’ll work with your van. Now, before we sort the extras, can I tell you about something most of our customers say is the best thing about their van once they're out on the road? We fit a 48V lithium silent compressor system using an ABAC professional compressor. Here's what that means for your day: it's completely silent — no generator noise while you work. It runs off the lithium battery, not the engine, so zero fuel cost. You can work with doors shut in winter — no fumes, no cold. The ABAC compressor runs at 10 bar at 100% duty cycle, flat out all day. The power system — battery, inverter and all electrical components — comes with a 5-year warranty. The ABAC compressor itself has a 12-month warranty with servicing only every 3,000 run hours. Want to include this on your build?"},{"role":"user","content":"not sure yet"},{"role":"assistant","content":"No problem — I'll add it to your config as an optional extra so you can see it priced up. Easy to remove if you decide against it."},{"role":"user","content":"ok"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Great — any specific extras you already know you want? Things like additional lighting, racking layout, tyre pressure display, livery and wrap — anything like that?"},{"role":"user","content":"I want tyre racking, full wrap and anything you can reccomend"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Got it — I'll include tyre racking and a full wrap for you. I'd also recommend the Compressor Upgrade to 12hp 270 Litre Electric Start and the Fini 9 meter Air Reel with Built-In Compressor. They're our most popular upgrades for setups like yours. Shall I add those too?"},{"role":"user","content":"yes please"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Great choice — I've added tyre racking, a full wrap, the 12hp 270L compressor upgrade, and the Fini 9m Air Reel to your build. How are you looking to fund this — buy outright, business lease, or spread the cost with finance?"},{"role":"user","content":"finance"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Got it — we'll set this up with finance. Last one and completely optional — would you like us to save your config and have one of the team give you a call to talk it through? If so, just drop your name and number."},{"role":"user","content":"yes"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Perfect! Just let me know your name and phone number, and I'll save this for one of the team to give you a call."},{"role":"user","content":"Gaz, 07525370107"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Thanks, Gaz! I've saved your details, and one of our team will be in touch soon to go over everything with you."}]	{"ownVan":true,"vanSize":null,"serviceType":"car","kitId":"pack-1-non-euro6-t1000","upgradeIds":["full-revalco-wrap","compressor-12hp-270l","air-reel-fini"],"financePlanId":null,"financePreference":"finance","includes48v":true,"contactName":"Gaz","contactPhone":"07525370107"}	Gaz	07525370107	car	\N	pack-1-non-euro6-t1000	finance	t	t	soft_no	["compressor-12hp-270l","air-reel-fini"]	["compr