5c05d251-ba9f-47cc-b889-950261596598	ai-1777460601522-2tr4l3y	abandoned	[{"role":"assistant","content":"Hi Gaz — I'm Max, the van builder for Mobile Tyre Van City. I'll ask you a few quick questions to put together a full, priced conversion spec for you — shouldn't take more than 5 minutes. So, are you just starting out in mobile tyres, expanding a fleet, or replacing a current van?"},{"role":"user","content":"expanding"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Got it, expanding the fleet — exciting times! Roughly how many tyre jobs are you looking to do per day?"},{"role":"user","content":"about 20"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Solid volume at 20 jobs a day — you're definitely in the high-use category. And what type of vehicles will you mainly be working on — cars and light vans, commercials like HGVs/LCVs, or a mix of both?"},{"role":"user","content":"mix of all"},{"role":"assistant","content":"A mix of everything — good to know. Do you already have a van you want us to convert, or do you need us to supply one as part of the package?"},{"role":"user","content":"I need a van"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Great — we’ve got a solid range of vans in stock, including Sprinters, full-size Transits, and Crafters. The team will go over specific models and pricing with you later. For now, let’s make sure the conversion is perfectly specced out. Just so you know, we offer two body lengths: MWB (Medium Wheelbase) for tighter spaces or LWB (Long Wheelbase) for maximum capacity and high-volume work. Based on your 20 jobs a day, I’d recommend LWB. Does that sound good, or are you leaning towards MWB?"},{"role":"user","content":"lwb"},{"role":"assistant","content":"LWB is the right call for your workload — plenty of space to handle everything. Now, do you want a standard tyre changer, or would you prefer a fully automatic one with assist arms? The fully auto makes run-flats and low-profile tyres much easier to handle, and most operators at your volume go for it."},{"role":"user","content":"fully auto"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Fully auto is the smart choice at your job volume — makes life a lot easier with those trickier tyres. Based on everything you've told me, I'd recommend our Gold package to keep up with your workload and mixed vehicle types. Here's what it includes:\\n• Light Pack\\n• Van Online CCTV/NVR System\\n• Apple CarPlay\\n• Accessories Pack 3\\n• Vehicle tracker\\n• Vehicle Immobiliser\\nThat’s a professional setup from day one. Shall we lock that in, or would you like to explore other options?"},{"role":"user","content":"sounds good"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Perfect — the Gold package will set you up nicely for your workload. Before we lock this in, can I tell you about something most of our customers say is the best upgrade for their van? We fit a 48V lithium silent compressor system. It’s completely silent, runs off a lithium battery — no fuel costs or fumes — and handles high-duty cycles all day at 10 bar. Want to include this on your build?"},{"role":"user","content":"yes add it"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Great choice — the 48V lithium silent compressor system will make a huge difference for your day-to-day work. Let me just confirm everything for you."}]	{"ownVan":false,"vanSize":"LWB","serviceType":"hybrid","isEuro6":true,"machineType":"fully-auto","packageId":"gold","kitId":"pack-4-euro6-t2000","upgradeIds":["light-pack-upgraded","van-cctv-system","apple-carplay","accessories-pack-3","vehicle-tracker","vehicle-immobiliser"],"financePlanId":null,"financePreference":null,"includes48v":true,"contactName":"gaz","contactPhone":"07525370107"}	gaz	07525370107	hybrid	LWB	pack-4-euro6-t2000	\N	t	t	yes	[]	[]	f	f	2026-04-29 11:03:30.197719	\N	\N	1d895c79-f97c-484c-8feb-a9d0ab2856db	\N	\N	[]	\N
